    "innovation": "Using climate models and satellite observations, this paper quantifies the exponential relationship between summer temperature and Antarctic surface melt, projecting that under a high-emissions scenario, many ice shelves will experience melt intensities by 2100 that have been historically associated with ice shelf collapse.",
