            "target_entity_instance": "HadGEM2-ES",
            "target_entity_type": "Source",
            "paragraph": "Under CORDEX, RACMO2 was forced at its lateral boundaries by two GCMS: EC-Earth2.3 (as previously discussed) and HadGEM2-ES (ref. 45).",
            "ontology_conformed": false,
            "evidence_validated": true,
            "valid": true,
            "eval": true
        },
