            "target_entity_type": "Resolution",
            "paragraph": "The full melt-T2m sensitivity analysis therefore included these observationally based meltwater fluxes and RACMO2-simulated melt using two different grid resolutions (27-km and 48-km) to account for methodological differences and spatial-resolution-induced biases.",
            "ontology_conformed": false,
